u_gralloc: stable-C IMapper v5 backend; resolve libhardware at runtime

Lets an NDK-built (android-stub) Vulkan driver import buffers from any
IMapper v5 gralloc while linking only LL-NDK libraries:

- u_gralloc_imapper5_stablec.c loads mapper.<suffix>.so (suffix from
  MESA_GRALLOC_MAPPER_SUFFIX / mesa.gralloc.mapper.suffix, or from
  IAllocator.getIMapperLibrarySuffix() via libbinder_ndk) and decodes the
  StandardMetadataType encoding itself instead of using libui.
- hw_get_module() is dlopen'ed from libhardware.so on demand, because
  libhardware is not LL-NDK. Drop the libhardware android stub.

